        {"encounter": "opd-2025", "kind": "clinic_letter", "title": "Orthopaedic clinic letter", "author": "Mr J. Hale", "author_role": "Consultant", "written_at": "2025-10-06T10:30:00Z", "body": "Diagnosis: severe tricompartmental OA R knee.\n\nFailed conservative mx incl. physio and intra-articular steroid. Pain at night, walking distance <100 yds. Discussed risks of TKR incl. infection, DVT/PE, stiffness, ongoing pain. She wishes to proceed. Listed for R TKR. HbA1c to be optimised pre-op."},
