        {"encounter": "tkr-2026", "kind": "ward_round", "title": "Ortho WR D4 post-op", "author": "Dr S. Patel", "author_role": "SHO", "written_at": "2026-03-13T08:35:00Z", "body": "WR (Mr Hale)\nD4 post R TKR. Pain controlled. Slow to mobilise - only bed to chair with frame, physio concerned re progress.\nO/E wound dry, R calf mildly swollen cf L, soft. Obs stable, afebrile.\nImp: slow progress post TKR\nPlan:\n- Push physio\n- Continue enoxaparin\n- Aim home w/e if stairs ok"},
